OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with clear intervals overnight.
OL,7,FA gentle breeze, with coastal showers
OL,8,Fbut drier inland. Feeling cooler than
OL,9,Fon previous nights, with a frost
OL,10,Fpossible in rural areas.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FSunny spells during the
OL,13,Fmorning, with cloud becoming more
OL,14,Fextensive during the afternoon.
OL,15,FIsolated light showers are possible,
OL,16,Fbut most places are expected to stay
OL,17,Fdry. Breezy along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
